OL,3,GNEWSAWhy does tragedy abuse remain a
OL,4,Aproblem in football?
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt has been almost 10 years since
OL,7,Fsix-year-old Sunderland fan Bradley
OL,8,FLowery died of a rare cancer after
OL,9,Fcapturing the hearts of the football
OL,10,Fworld.
OL,12,FThe youngster's name appeared back in
OL,13,Fthe headlines this week after a video
OL,14,Fon social media appeared to show a
OL,15,FCoventry City fan taunting opposition
OL,16,FSunderland fans with his photo during
OL,17,Ftheir Premier League match last
OL,18,FSaturday.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,399,390,260,160,0,100
