OL,3,GNEWSAWhy does tragedy abuse remain a
OL,4,Aproblem in football?
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement following the incident,
OL,7,FBradley's mother, Gemma Lowery, said it
OL,8,Fwas "heart-breaking" and her "beautiful
OL,9,Fboy deserves to be remembered with
OL,10,Flove, not hate".
OL,12,FThe incident has once again raised the
OL,13,Ftopic of tragedy abuse in football and
OL,14,Fwhy it continues despite widespread
OL,15,Fefforts to stamp it out.
